<h1>Icons</h1>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">Icons are used for the header, favicon, apple touch icon, and panel toggle button.</p>

<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Static override</h2>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">Replace the defaults by placing files with the same names in <code>app/assets/images/layered_ui/</code> in your host app.</p>

<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Files</h2>

<div class="l-ui-container--table l-ui-utility--mt-lg">
  <table class="l-ui-table">
    <caption class="l-ui-sr-only">Icon files</caption>
    <thead class="l-ui-table__header">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">File</th>
        <th class="l-ui-table__header-cell" scope="col">Used for</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody class="l-ui-table__body">
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>icon_light.svg</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Header icon and favicon (light theme) - also overridable via <code>content_for :l_ui_icon_light</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>icon_dark.svg</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Header icon and favicon (dark theme) - also overridable via <code>content_for :l_ui_icon_dark</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>apple_touch_icon.png</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Apple touch icon - also overridable via <code>content_for :l_ui_apple_touch_icon</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>panel_icon_light.svg</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Panel toggle button (light theme) - also overridable via <code>content_for :l_ui_panel_icon_light</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th class="l-ui-table__cell--primary" scope="row"><code>panel_icon_dark.svg</code></th>
        <td class="l-ui-table__cell">Panel toggle button (dark theme) - also overridable via <code>content_for :l_ui_panel_icon_dark</code></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<h2 class="l-ui-utility--mt-2xl">Dynamic override</h2>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">The header icon (not the favicon) can be overridden per-request using <code>content_for</code>:</p>

<pre class="l-ui-surface l-ui-utility--mt-lg"><code>&lt;% content_for :l_ui_icon_light do %&gt;
  &lt;%= image_tag @tenant.icon_light_url, alt: "", class: "l-ui-header__icon l-ui-header__icon--light" %&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;

&lt;% content_for :l_ui_icon_dark do %&gt;
  &lt;%= image_tag @tenant.icon_dark_url, alt: "", class: "l-ui-header__icon l-ui-header__icon--dark" %&gt;
&lt;% end %&gt;</code></pre>

<p class="l-ui-utility--mt-md">The panel icon can be overridden the same way using <code>:l_ui_panel_icon_light</code> and <code>:l_ui_panel_icon_dark</code>. For the apple touch icon, yield the entire <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> tag via <code>:l_ui_apple_touch_icon</code>. Favicon overrides require static file replacement.</p>
